        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes" value="Repeated user symbols represent the same roles. All access remains subject to permissions.&#10;Guardians access linked tenants only and acknowledge overnight leave only. Geofencing events come from the tenant's smartphone.&#10;Contracts, guardian links, confidential-report review, deposit finalization and analytics remain owner-controlled.&#10;Uploaded receipts, images and documents are linked to their records. Flagged curfew events require staff review." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="1070" width="1540" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
